concept_subject_offering_facts`, `concept_course_catalog_sources`, `concept_department_dimension` (retrieved; the last three were screened as context-only).\n\n**Column concepts:** `column_concept_year_columns` (academic vs fiscal vs aid vs degree year), `column_concept_term_code` (TERM_CODE is the universal term join key), `column_concept_material_status_key` ('RQ' = required in TIP domain).\n\n**Metrics (precedents retrieved in full):** dw_2957, dw_4701, dw_2958, dw_41, dw_4061, dw_3417, dw_3224. Other Phase 1 metric hits (dw_4558, dw_3612, dw_3973, dw_3357, dw_4583, dw_4826, dw_2895, dw_1393, dw_1023, dw_359, dw_2597, dw_3966, dw_4325, dw_3131, dw_2850, dw_1288, dw_3609, dw_2272, dw_1335, dw_1350, dw_1357, etc.) were screened via their descriptions; those sharing the task shape are covered in §3d.\n\n## 2. Lineage & Relationships\n\n- `semantic_graph(query_neighbors, TIP_DETAIL, both)`: outgoing joins → ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL, ACADEMIC_TERMS, TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED, TIP_MATERIAL, TIP_MATERIAL_STATUS, COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED, SUBJECT_SUMMARY, SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY; incoming joins ← LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED, LIBRARY_RESERVE_MATRL_DETAIL, IAP_SUBJECT_DETAIL, SUBJECT_OFFERED. Concept membership: `concept_course_material_programs`. Column concepts: term_code, subject_id, material_status_key.\n- `concept_academic_term_dimension` decision guide: \"Questions referring to 'the current term', 'the previous term' … Use ACADEMIC_TERM_PARAMETER to resolve the relative reference to a TERM_CODE\"; \"Questions needing academic year … over the widest term coverage: Use ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL\".\n- `column_concept_term_code` decision guide: all fact tables join term dimensions via TERM_CODE equality.\n- Precedent lineage (from metric SQL): dw_2957 → ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL ⋈ ACADEMIC_TERMS; dw_41 → ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL ⋈ COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED on TERM_CODE; dw_3417/dw_3224 → ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL ⋈ ACADEMIC_TERM_PARAMETER on TERM_CODE; dw_4701/dw_4061 → multi-CTE per-measure aggregation joined on ACADEMIC_YEAR.\n\n## 3. Similar-Entity Differences\n\n**3a. Dimension matrix (term tables):**\n\n| Dimension | ACADEMIC_TERMS | ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL | ACADEMIC_TERM_PARAMETER |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Coverage | status-tracked subset | all terms (superset) — concept comparison | exactly 3 rows — table desc |\n| Unique cols | IS_REGULAR_TERM, TERM_STATUS, ADD/DROP_DATE | none beyond shared | TERM_PARAMETER, TERM_INDICATOR — concept comparison |\n| Role | regular-term/status filters | academic year/desc source for yearly stats | resolving 'current/previous term' — concept decision_guide |\n| Join key | TERM_CODE | TERM_CODE | TERM_CODE |\n\n**3b. Task-Requirement Fitness:**\n\n| Requirement | Candidate → status |\n|---|---|\n| academic year + description output | ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL.ACADEMIC_YEAR / ACADEMIC_YEAR_DESC → SUPPORTED (hint mapping; columns verified in `semantic_get`) |\n| variance of TIP record count | TIP_DETAIL.RECORD_COUNT → SUPPORTED (column desc: \"used in material-count statistics\"); VARIANCE() precedent dw_2958/dw_41 |\n| \"current or previous terms\" filter | ACADEMIC_TERM_PARAMETER.TERM_PARAMETER IN ('SIS_CURRENT_TERM','SIS_PREVIOUS_TERM') → SUPPORTED (hint maps this phrase to TERM_PARAMETER; values documented in column def). ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL.TERM_STATUS_INDICATOR IN ('C','P') also exists but is NOT the hinted column |\n| geometric mean of required-material record counts > 0 | TIP_DETAIL.RECORD_COUNT + TIP_MATERIAL_STATUS_KEY='RQ' → SUPPORTED (hint mapping; 'RQ'=Required per TIP_MATERIAL_STATUS; EXP(AVG(LN())) precedent dw_2957/dw_4061/dw_4701) |\n| \"for all subjects offered in that year\" scope | ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL.TERM_CODE join → SUPPORTED; no direct TIP_DETAIL↔COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED join key is listed in the hints, so the year-scoping runs through TERM_CODE |\n| unique departments offering subjects | COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.DEPARTMENT_CODE → SUPPORTED (hint mapping; COUNT(DISTINCT …)) |\n| order by variance desc, no rounding | raw VARIANCE() output → SUPPORTED |\n\n**3c. Wording-to-Field Anchoring:** \"current or previous terms\" lexically matches ACADEMIC_TERM_PARAMETER.TERM_PARAMETER ('SIS_CURRENT_TERM'/'SIS_PREVIOUS_TERM') per the hint; it excludes TERM_STATUS_INDICATOR (not hinted). \"Required course materials\" anchors to TIP_MATERIAL_STATUS_KEY='RQ' (decision_guide: \"'RQ' for required only\"). \"Record count\" anchors to TIP_DETAIL.RECORD_COUNT (hint). \"Academic year\" anchors to ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL.ACADEMIC_YEAR (hint), not COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.ACADEMIC_YEAR — `column_concept_year_columns` warns these can disagree; the hint resolves the ambiguity. Critically, the question attaches **different filters to different measures** (term-parameter filter only to the variance; RQ/>0 only to the geometric mean; neither to the department count), so the measures have different populations and must be aggregated separately then joined on ACADEMIC_YEAR — the same pattern as precedent dw_4701.\n\n**3d. Precedent Usage Evidence:** Per-measure-filter yearly reports with separate CTEs joined on academic year: 2 precedents (dw_4701, dw_3417). Single-population yearly variance reports: dw_41, dw_2958, dw_1023 (shared WHERE for all measures — not this task's shape since filters differ per measure). Geometric-mean formula EXP(AVG(LN(x))) with >0 guard: 3 precedents (dw_2957, dw_4061, dw_4701). VARIANCE() for dispersion: dw_2958, dw_41. ACADEMIC_TERM_PARAMETER joined on TERM_CODE for relative-term resolution: dw_3417, dw_3224.\n\n## 4. Business Usage\n\n- **TIP_DETAIL**: consumed by material-count metrics (dw_4558, dw_3612, dw_3973, dw_2895) — windowed averages of RECORD_COUNT, min record counts, 'RQ' filtering; member of `concept_course_material_programs`.\n- **ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL**: the year/description source for yearly statistics (dw_2957, dw_41, dw_4826); joined on TERM_CODE by virtually every term-scoped metric.\n- **ACADEMIC_TERM_PARAMETER**: resolves 'current/previous/upcoming